## 附加声明 / Additional Notice

本项目通过 UI 自动化与本地数据库读取操作**微信 Windows 客户端**，这类行为可能
不符合微信的用户协议，存在账号被限制或封禁的风险。请仅在**你自己的次要账号**上
使用，并自行承担全部风险。

This project automates the WeChat Windows client through UI automation and local
database reads. Such use may violate WeChat's Terms of Service and carries the
risk of account restriction or ban. Use it only on **your own secondary
account**, entirely at your own risk.

本项目与腾讯 / 微信官方无任何关联。
This project is not affiliated with Tencent or WeChat.
